s10-1-p5 : Block
s10-1-p5 = prose (cons "A suspended computation needs additional state: its residual expression, dependency observations, pending request, and the continuations waiting on its result. A failure is not a successful result. A response from the outside world cannot be silently replayed as though it were a pure lookup. These are exact distinctions about computation and interaction, not arbitrary divisions into caching, queueing, and workflow products." nil)
